      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VINRAAM (3) was heavily bet last time out at Hobart and after settling back came home hard to score in a well-timed run by senior rider Sanderson. Looks ideally suited by the mile and is a progressive type. Can measure up again. BAILED (2) is a former Victorian who has had two starts in Tassie for a second on the Devonport synthetic two back then a maiden win there last time. Has upside and should run well again. OUTSIDETHESQUARE (8) is a former Victorian who is a winner from the four starts and wasn't far away last time at Ballarat on the synthetic. Rates well here on best figures and expected to measure up. BELLA CHINKARA (4) is overdue and expected to go close. SOUTH GEORGIA (9) doesn't win often but made a nice return and goes well second-up.",
